'''Lightmother Aset''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties: The Majestic Zeus]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] increases health, damage, range and [[Wave Attack|Wave]] level and gains immunity to Freeze and Toxic.

