==Trivia==
*Aset is one of the names of the Egyptian goddess [[wikipedia:Isis|Isis]], who is known for healing, powerful magic and funerary rites.
*The symbol on the medallion floating above Aset is the [[wikipedia:Eye of Horus|Eye of Horus]].
*''[[Wikipedia:Nefer|Nefer]]'' is the conventional Egyptological vocalization of the hieroglyph 𓄤, meaning "good" or "beautiful".
*Aset is the only [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|Almighty]] whose [[True Form]] receives any change to their design beyond the standard fruit and fairy, albeit only in the form of some thicker outlines and position adjustments to the feathers around her waist.
*Aset's [[Strengthen]] ability isn't mentioned in any of her descriptions.

